Z||000004||jlhuber||11-23-2000||05:27 PM||||I have three different free services that I use, Juno, Freeinternet, and NetZero.  Of those, I prefer to use NetZero.  Here is the link for anyone interested http;//www.netzero.com  It does have banners, but you can use AOL, Yahoo, ICQ and other messenger programs with your NetZero connection.  As with all other free services, there is no telling how long it will remain free though.  Ah well, that is the way the cookie crumbles I guess.<P>------------------<BR>--Jess--<P>"To each his own"||||reg||2
